Pressed flags are global sets; endFrame after both fighters update and after CPU. Good.

Menu fighters idle: update with empty intent (they will face each other and idle). But fighter.update requires game and uses this.other; works. Avoid meter regen? fine.

Match end victory: winner.victory true.

Reset positions with facing: f1 at 400 facing 1; f2 at 880 facing -1. Reset facing logic will face opponent anyway.

Round timer 75, display Math.ceil.

