Track `roundResult = {winnerId, reason}` for HUD text.

Implement startMatch resets fighters (resetMatch), round=1, state intro. Also reset fx, projectiles, announcements, timer.

Need `this.fighters` array created in constructor with palettes and start x. On menu state, positions x 430 and 850; fighters idle.

Attract mode maybe subtle: in menu, fighters slowly walk? Could have them spar idly? Keep them idle, facing off, background alive.

Game.resetToMenu(): state menu; fighters reset (health full, idle), positions; ui callbacks.

